{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "story_12fce_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_12fce_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "Certain Choices",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_12fce_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a397ed2a54f7a8936f472a1c24ec3315161577e84bf06235fe1c9ce4384775d6",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You shouldn't follow me.\nWhere I am going, the flames of war rage unchecked.\nYou'd only be in the way. No need to get yourself killed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Savra, what are you doing, standing there? Get down if you want to live!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*Sarkaz profanity*! Incoming! Take cover and keep your head down!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "*Cough* *cough*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You still alive?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "I'm fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They found our vantage point. We don't have much time left! Get a move on!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Again, so soon?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Argghhh! Son of a...! My leg!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "(Uses Arts)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "This way!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*Cough*. Thanks, brother."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "All I did was find us some cover. No need to thank me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "Is your leg doing okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm fine. I've been scratched up like this many times before. I'll be okay with a bandage."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm probably not one to talk, but you don't seem like you can hold your own in a fight that well. I'm surprised you managed to survive this long."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I saw you use Arts to move the cover. That's the technique of a seasoned veteran."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How long have you been on the battlefield?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "I've been through training many times, but I'm afraid this is my first deployment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "I only made it this far thanks to luck. I haven't done anything too great."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, you're a humble one, I'll give you that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Anyway, we really can't keep this up for much longer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The bigwigs are probably having an easy time, but this is starting to be a bit too much to bear for the rest of us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Looks like we're the only ones left here. I wonder how the others are doing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "I got separated from my team... Our ambush failed, and the enemy scattered us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "It doesn't look like much is happening up ahead. I'm guessing anyone who charged up ahead are all..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, what a coincidence. It's the same for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm not expecting them to go back to help me at this point."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "The mission may be a failure, but I'm not planning on dying here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "I'll scout out our surroundings. We may be trapped, but there has to be a way to break out of this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Scout? You?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Listen, I'm not trying to look down on you, brother."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But I promise, it doesn't matter how much cover your Arts can make you. The moment you poke your head out, you'll be blown to pieces."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My suggestion: We stay here and observe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "I'm afraid we can't do that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "3 o'clock... We've got company."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Those freaking Kuranta?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "They're light infantry. Most likely the Kuranta mercenaries. There may be others as well... They work together fairly often, after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "Once they charge in here, we won't have anywhere to run."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "They might even have some caster drones with them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How'd you know that much?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "Simple deduction, guesswork, and experience."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "I could be wrong, of course, but that should more or less be it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "We may stand out if we go now, but we can't hide here for very long."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you know so much about them, do you have a way to take them out too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "I'm afraid not with my Arts. I'll probably be killed the moment I try to attack."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "Honestly, running away is about all I can manage right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hahahaha, sounds like whoever hired you really got a lemon."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They're losing this war because they're too stingy and only bought men like you. You get what you pay for."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "By the way, before I forget..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's your name, Savra?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "I have many names. You can call me 46A for now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Heh, is that a name now? Sounds more like a model number for some kind of appliance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "It's just one of my codenames. You can call me that for the time being."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, it sounds to me you haven't made up your mind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "My name isn't important."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Guess it isn't. Looks like you're the same as me. Just playing it by ear, earning our keep."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Was that an explosion?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Quick, 46A! Let's go!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've been a merc for a long time, but this is my first time seeing anyone use drones to guide artillery fire."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Those drone casters are getting way too hard to deal with these days."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If we'd found out sooner, so many of us would still be alive..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "I tried to cover our tracks. Hopefully that will buy us some time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You know all kinds of Arts, don't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why don't you take care of these wounds for me while you are at it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "Sorry, I don't know healing Arts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's fine. Just figured I'd ask."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "Our medic was the second one to go missing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't let it get to you, brother. It happens pretty often out here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If it wasn't for you, the Kuranta would've blown a hole through my guts already."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "So nobody else made it out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Looks like it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But that also means we're safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Can you walk on your own?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "I'm fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let's keep going, then. The rendezvous point shouldn't be much further. If we keep this up, we should be there in about an hour."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "Good."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I really backed the wrong horse this time. The nobles were paying top dollar, so I figured this one was a sure win."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who knew we'd get all those mortar shells dropped on us? The moment that happened, everyone just took off, running for dear life."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I feel sorry for those brothers I've fought alongside over the years."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They got their money, but at what cost?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*Sigh*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How about you, 46A? You here because of how much they were willing to pay, too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "There were some supplies I needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hah, no need to sugarcoat it like that. All of us are putting our lives on the line to earn our crust."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "I'm looking for someone as well."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Looking for someone? What, on the battlefield?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "That's correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who are you looking for? Family? An enemy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "Someone I owe my life."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hoh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's interesting."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, it sounds like something you'd do, but you're probably looking in the wrong place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "It's a life debt, and—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Fine, whatever. Let me give you a bit of advice. Don't let yourself be taken advantage of!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I wasn't going to say this, but you're a weird one. Do you really think you can find the one who saved your life in Kazdel?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Maybe they weren't even trying to save you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Think about all those men you've worked for up till now, all the people you've worked with. All of them ready to turn against you at a moment's notice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Maybe the moment you find them, they'll—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I never imagined I would make such a mistake. I didn't see the attack coming at all.\nWere those explosives? Arts?\nMy ears are buzzing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*Pant*... *pant*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But I'm not going to die here.\nEven if I can't see anything, even if I have to crawl my way out of here, I am going to live."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You always make it through everything alive, Savra."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But I never thought you'd make it this far."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You are not like those good-for-nothings."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who are you...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You've made it this far. You have my approval."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I guess I must also give you a conclusion."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Will you face your past?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Or will you face the future?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Make your decision."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Savra feebly holds his staff up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Can I come with you this time, Owl?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "Rise and shine, young'un."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "12F",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "Ughh......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "12F",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "What are you doing here, Mr. Rangers...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "Everyone else is busy today, so it's just us two Savra sharing drinks and conversation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "Do you remember now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "12F",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "R-Right... It's coming back to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "Here, have some cold water."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "12F",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "Try rubbing your eyes. Harder."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "12F",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "*Phew*... *huff*."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "This is how I used to sober myself up when I was your age. It does the trick, doesn't it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "12F",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "I suppose. Thank you, Mr. Rangers."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "No need to thank me. We're both Savra."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "This is a kind of remedy I came up with. Only works on us folk."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rangers",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "Were you dreaming, 12F? You seemed rather stiff."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "12F",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "Oh, I guess I did have a rather strange dream."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "12F",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "Something from the past came back to me, that's all."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "Tell me. What's your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "46A",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "I... I don't have a name... Only a codename."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "Well, you just follow me from here on out. Like I said, there'll be far more dangers waiting ahead of you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "How far you can make it. Well, that depends on you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "Who you've been up till now just died here. Today is the day you died. It's also the day you were born."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "Right, why don't I give you a new name as a present?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "Let's see. It's March 3rd today..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_009_12fce_1",
      "operatorId": "char_009_12fce",
      "portraitKey": "char_009_12fce",
      "text": "Alright, you'll be 12F from here on out."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
